{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>日本天后濱崎步，2000年推出單曲《SEASON》大賣逾120萬張成為經典。最近，她與Hip Hop男歌手AK-69合唱「令和版」《SEASON》，更親自操刀，挑戰一鏡到底拍攝MV。</p><p>MV於昨日在網上公開，兩人在東京鐵塔夜景下對唱。48歲的濱崎步，更重現2001年單曲《evolution》的金色短髮、牛仔Tubetop、腰間掛「狐狸尾巴」吊飾的經典造型，勾起不少歌迷的集體回憶。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.662714+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":198,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T13:03:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T19:58:18.539487+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T13:38:38.965382+00:00","content_hash":"0200c90c6b1b7dea24d1ff789aa34b77c1bddd40675e7b6f31f1eff6ecfee27e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T13:41:50.662714+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}